# FLAN-T5 Summarizer & Q&A Assistant

This project provides a **lightweight FLAN-T5-based assistant** for:

- Summarizing text into bullet points
- Answering questions from a local context (`context.txt`)

---
The project architecture is as follows:

                    ┌──────────────────────┐
                    │      CLI User        │
                    └──────────┬───────────┘
                               │
                 ┌─────────────┴─────────────┐
                 │                           │
                 ▼                           ▼
          Summarization                  Q&A
                 │                           │
                 ▼                           ▼
       Build summarization             Load context.txt
             prompt                         │
                 │                          │
                 │                    User question
                 │                          │
                 └─────────────┬────────────┘
                               ▼
                    Marvellous_run_flan()
                               │
                               ▼
                         Tokenizer
                               │
                               ▼
                       Input token IDs
                               │
                               ▼
                    ┌───────────────────┐
                    │    FLAN-T5-small  │
                    │                   │
                    │ Encoder           │
                    │       ↓           │
                    │ Decoder           │
                    └─────────┬─────────┘
                              │
                              ▼
                       Generated IDs
                              │
                              ▼
                         Tokenizer
                          decode()
                              │
                              ▼
                         Text output

---

